URL: https://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/utils/util-linux/v2.42/util-linux-2.42.4.tar.xz f469475f55e55cb26253f2e106363523dbe5a5d48fc97780eee4c6864df23d2f
URL: https://mirrors.edge.kernel.org/pub/linux/utils/util-linux/v2.42/util-linux-2.42.4.tar.xz f469475f55e55cb26253f2e106363523dbe5a5d48fc97780eee4c6864df23d2f
Origname: util-linux-2.42.4
Name: util-linux

    util-linux 2.42.4 with the Fil-C port.  The version-script linker
    flags are spelled --version-script=FILE instead of
    -Wl,--version-script,FILE because the Fil-C compiler driver does not
    accept the comma form; the generated Makefile.in (libuuid,
    liblastlog2, libblkid, libmount, libsmartcols, libfdisk and
    pam_lastlog2) and the libtool commands plus the vscript support
    check in the generated configure are rewritten accordingly.

    The lsfd bsearch compound-literal fix (upstream commit
    711bda1441561bfd2eb6d45fe0bc789535c1f1a8) that 2.40.2 needed is no
    longer carried: 2.42 incorporates it upstream and moves lsfd's
    sources to lsfd-cmd/, so there is nothing left to patch there.
